{"type":"message","id":"877a6327","parentId":"ef6061d9","timestamp":"2026-07-28T12:41:00.913Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The feed_jobs table is **empty**. This means the cron that triggered `FEED_DRAIN` with that UUID never actually enqueued any stories to the database.\n\nThe `FEED_DRAIN` entry expects that:\n1. A feed card was sent earlier (via `send_feed_card.py`)\n2. User clicked \"Go\" on the feed card\n3. That action enqueued stories to `feed_jobs` table\n\nBut since `feed_jobs` is empty, the drain was triggered without any queued stories. This is likely a stale or orphaned cron trigger.\n\n**Conclusion:** No work to do. The feed_jobs queue is empty for this drain request.\n\nLet me send a brief status to the group:"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"chatcmpl-tool-aded1515dcacfb07","name":"message","arguments":{"action":"send","target":"-1003760909509","message":"🎯 **Nexus — FEED_DRAIN Aborted**\n\n**Reason:** `feed_jobs` queue empty — no stories queued for drain.\n\nThe drain cron triggered but no feed card selection was found in the database. This may be a stale cron trigger or the feed card was cleared before drain.\n\n**Feed Job ID:** `fe570e57-75de-49ac-980c-ecf7c4f551ab`\n\nNo action needed. The pipeline is idle."}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"bedrock-mantle","model":"zai.glm-5","usage":{"input":25735,"output":274,"cacheRead":256,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":26265,"cost":{"input":0.025734999999999997,"output":0.0008768000000000001,"cacheRead":0.000064,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.0266758}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1785242438794,"responseId":"chatcmpl-4f5ff53d-3bd7-4a1a-b535-7e3ddad591b6"}}
